<title>ESTONIA: PRODUCER PRICE INDEX UP 0.8 MO/MO IN FEB.</title>
<headline>PRODUCER PRICE INDEX UP 0.8 MO/MO IN FEB.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Producer Price Index</p>
<p>(PPI) rose by a month-on-month 0.8 percent in February compared</p>
<p>to January's monthly 0.9 percent rise, the statistics office</p>
<p>said on Thursday.</p>
<p> PPI			  Feb 97  Jan 97  Feb 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change    0.8    0.9	0.9</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	8.3    8.4     14.2</p>
</text>
